@Rickasaurus can you explain how the example I posted, or one similar to it, creates a "keyword salad"? I don't follow the point you're trying to make. [The keyword is already reserved, so it's not like we can use it for ourselves.](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/articles/fsharp/language-reference/keyword-reference#see-also)

